  "description": "Villa Amarilla is located in the prestigious residential area of Guadalmina, San Pedro de Alcántara, one of Marbella’s most established and sought-after neighbourhoods. Surrounded by greenery and within easy reach of the coast, renowned golf courses, beach clubs, restaurants, supermarkets, and the vibrant areas of Puerto Banús and Marbella, the villa offers an excellent balance of privacy, comfort, and accessibility.\n\nThis elegant Mediterranean-style villa is set within beautifully maintained private gardens and offers a peaceful retreat for families and couples looking to enjoy the Costa del Sol in a spacious and exclusive setting. With four bedrooms, generous indoor and outdoor living areas, a private swimming pool, and a separate guest apartment, the property is particularly well suited to guests seeking both shared spaces and additional privacy.\n\nOn entering the main house, guests are welcomed into bright and characterful interiors with elegant architectural details, arched windows and doors, carefully selected furnishings, and a warm residential atmosphere. The main living areas are designed for both relaxation and entertaining, with comfortable lounge spaces and direct connections to the terraces and gardens.\n\nThe fully equipped kitchen provides everything needed for a comfortable stay, while the dining areas offer inviting settings for relaxed breakfasts, family meals, and longer evenings together. Throughout the property, the interiors combine traditional Mediterranean character with refined decorative touches, creating a distinctive and welcoming home.\n\nThe villa features four bedrooms, all with en-suite bathrooms. Three bedrooms are located within the main house, while the fourth is set within a separate guest apartment with its own private entrance. This independent accommodation is ideal for guests seeking additional privacy, extended family members, or accompanying staff.\n\nOutside, Villa Amarilla truly comes into its own. The landscaped gardens are filled with mature trees, palms, and lush greenery, creating a private oasis around the property. At the heart of the outdoor space is the private swimming pool, surrounded by sunbathing areas and generous lawns where guests can unwind throughout the day.\n\nSeveral covered and open-air terraces provide a variety of spaces for outdoor living, from comfortable lounge areas overlooking the garden and pool to al fresco dining spaces ideal for long summer lunches and evening gatherings. The combination of shaded terraces, open lawns, and established gardens allows guests to enjoy Marbella’s climate throughout the day.\n\nThe property also benefits from private parking and a peaceful residential setting, while remaining conveniently positioned for exploring the surrounding area. Guadalmina’s golf courses, nearby beaches, San Pedro de Alcántara, Puerto Banús, and Marbella are all within easy reach, making Villa Amarilla an excellent base for enjoying the very best of the Costa del Sol.\n\nWhether spending the day beside the private pool, enjoying relaxed meals on the terrace, exploring Marbella’s beaches and restaurants, or simply making the most of the villa’s peaceful gardens, Villa Amarilla offers an elegant and comfortable setting for a memorable Mediterranean stay.\n\nPlease note that we welcome families and couples only, no groups under 30, and no hen or stag parties. Should you fall outside of this category but wish to book nonetheless, please send us an enquiry detailing a bit more about yourself and the group that you will be travelling with so we can request this for you.\n\nDon’t forget to ask about our concierge service! We look forward to welcoming you.",
